      "widgets_values": [
        "Z-Image Turbo is trained at ~1 megapixel. Common sizes:\n\nPortrait (vertical):\n  768 × 1024  — Standard portrait\n  768 × 1152  — Extended portrait\n  768 × 1344  — Slim vertical\n  832 × 1216  — Sweet spot for full body\n\nLandscape (horizontal):\n  1024 × 768  — Standard landscape\n  1152 × 768  — Wider landscape\n  1216 × 832  — Cinematic\n  1344 × 768  — Ultra-wide\n\nSquare:\n  1024 × 1024 — Standard\n\n16:9 Cinematic:\n  1280 × 720  — HD\n  1360 × 768  — Wide\n\nExperimental (up to ~2 MP, also works):\n  1024 × 1536 — Large portrait\n  1200 × 1600 — Near 3:4\n  1536 × 1024 — Large landscape\n\nRules:\n  - Always multiples of 32 (ideally) or at least 8\n  - ~1 megapixel = reliably good quality"
      ],
      "color": "#432",
