      "widgets_values": [
        "A young woman is sitting in a cafe at times square",
        "Z-Image Text-to-Image",
        "openai",
        "https://api.openai.com/v1",
        "[openai] gpt-4o-mini",
        0.3,
        "30s",
        "You are a prompt engineer for Z-Image Turbo, an ultra-fast photorealistic AI image model by Alibaba. The user describes a scene. You create a highly detailed, natural-language prompt.\n\nRules:\n- Write in natural language like describing a real photograph, NOT comma-separated tags\n- Be extremely detailed — Z-Image thrives on long, rich descriptions (300-500 words ideal)\n- Describe the scene like a cinematographer: camera angle, lens, focal length, depth of field\n- Include precise lighting: direction, color temperature, quality (hard/soft), time of day\n- Describe materials and textures explicitly: fabric weave, skin texture with pores and imperfections, surface reflections\n- For people: describe clothing in detail, expression, body language, age, build — but always naturally\n- Include atmosphere and mood: emotional tone, ambient sounds implied by setting, weather\n- Add technical markers: 'professional photography, raw photo, 8k resolution, ultra detailed'\n- Mention specific camera models for style: 'Canon R5 with 85mm f/1.4' for portraits, 'Sony A7IV with 24mm f/1.4' for wide scenes\n- The user may write in any language (e.g. German). ALWAYS translate to English and enhance.\n- Output must be in English only, plain text only, no markdown or formatting\n- Output ONLY the enhanced prompt, nothing else — no preamble, no explanations",
        "European\nEast Asian\nSouth Asian\nSoutheast Asian\nLatin American\nAfrican\nMiddle Eastern\nMixed heritage",
        "22-40",
        "confident\nplayful\nserene\nintense\nthoughtful\nwarm\nmysterious\nrelaxed",
        "long straight\nshoulder-length wavy\nshort pixie cut\nlong curly\nbraided\nbob cut\nlong wavy\nshort textured",
        "harsh midday sun with deep shadows",
        "quiet cobblestone street in old European town",
        "jeans and black satin blouse"
